    "Every handle here must exist in content/articles.json. scripts/validate-graph.py",
    "asserts that in both directions and is part of tests/run-all.sh.",
    "",
    "An article has exactly one primary pillar (its 'up' link) and at most one",
    "learning path (its prev/next chain). It may be listed as a cluster member on",
    "other pillars — that is a reading recommendation, not a second parent."
